fic names are not  disclosed in the indictment mr molofi of  uh is is obviously a public uh  personality and um we'll find uh find  plenty of information of them on open  source  and then if i may it's been several  weeks since the department received a  referral from congress uh on mark  meadows and the the house is poised to  vote again on two referrals today what  do you say to those who may be losing  confidence in the department because  it's taking so long and do you have  concerns that congressional referrals  become somewhat toothless if the  department doesn't take enforcement  action so the meadows referral went to  the united states attorney for the  district of columbia it's been made  quite public and we will follow the  facts in the law wherever they lead we  don't comment any further on  investigations thanks all right thank  you everybody thank you  you
 

